## Model card

- **Name:** Iceman Free (`opencode/iceman-free`)
- **Short description:** OpenCode Console's stealth model, free for a limited time — launched 2026-11-06, the sibling of `big-pickle` and `crouton-alpha-free` (now deprecated 2026-11-09, revealed as Muse Ember). Identity undisclosed; no weights, no API, no benchmark table.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Console free route `opencode/iceman-free` (owner: `opencode`); Chat Completions over `https://opencode.ai/inference/openai/v1`; OpenAI-compatible.
- **Release / knowledge:** released 2026-11-06; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `opencode/iceman-free` (registry); tracked in this dataset as `iceman`
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens; max output 131,072 tokens (OpenCode inference registry, fetched 2026-11-10).
- **Modalities:** text in → text out (registry); reasoning yes; tool calls yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free (0.0 credits) during the limited-time window; after the window, availability TBD. OpenCode privacy note: during the free period, collected data is retained and used to improve the model — do not submit confidential data.
- **Architecture:** stealth/undisclosed (open_weights: false).

