### Conflicting claims compared (2nd pass)

- OpenCode docs Console models page (fetched 2026-11-10): `iceman-free` in the table; free tier; privacy note — data retained to improve the model; restricted from none; "Iceman Free is a stealth model that's free on OpenCode for a limited time."
- OpenCode inference registry (`opencode.ai/inference/v1/models`, fetched 2026-11-10): `iceman-free` — release 2026-11-06, text-only, 262K ctx / 131K out, reasoning + tools supported, $0.
- Sibling pattern: `crouton-alpha-free` → revealed 2026-11-09 as Muse Ember (Meta). Iceman Free is the next stealth drop; identity cannot be assumed to be Muse Ember or any other known model (registry keeps them separate).
- Everything else about the model — size, lab, benchmarks, modalities beyond text — is undisclosed. No source conflicts beyond that.

